WEBVTT

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:30.088
and I never felt powerful.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.866
I was always just one big ball
of nervous, soft energy,

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.152
and superheroes,
much like the bullies at school,

00:00:39.176 --> 00:00:41.840
didn't seem to have
a lot of room for that, for me.

00:00:42.772 --> 00:00:44.151
So I stayed away.

00:00:45.565 --> 00:00:47.867
And besides, who needs superheroes

00:00:47.891 --> 00:00:50.895
when you're surrounded
by Puerto Rican women from the Bronx?

00:00:50.919 --> 00:00:53.018
(Laughter)

00:00:53.042 --> 00:00:56.295
My tías were cops and paramedics,

00:00:56.319 --> 00:01:00.160
my abuelas were seamstresses
and sold jewelry up the street,